<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46965" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠμέν</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		 Conj., correl. to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠδέ</span> (from
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέν,
			δέ</span>), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>both . .
			</i> and . . , 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠ. νέοι ἠδὲ γέροντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.789
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠ. ἀνακλῖναι πυκινὸν νέφος ἠδ᾽
					ἐπιθεῖναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					5.751
				</span></i>
			; sts. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καί</span> is added to 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠδέ, ἠ. θεὸν ἠδὲ καὶ ἄνδρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					5.128
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠ. δέμας ἠδὲ καὶ αὐδήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					2.268
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠ. δή ποτ᾽ ἐμεῦ πάρος ἔκλυες . . ἠδ᾽
					ἔτι καὶ νῦν μοι . . ἐπικρήηνον ἐέλδωρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					1.453
				</span></i>
			: rarely folld. by <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέ</span> or
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τε</span>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ἠ . . . πολλοὶ δέ . . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					12.428
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠ. ὅσοι χαλεποί . . οἵ τε φιλόξεινοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					8.575
				</span></i>
			: more freq. by <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καί</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				15.664
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				670
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				339
			</span></i>.</div>
